    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFINALLOOP\u300b is a card building rougelike game\uff0cThe game uses real-time combat. Discover stronger combinations, build the strongest loops, and be prepared not to stop playing your cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic building: Hundreds of cards with different attributes and effects, constantly strengthen your deck, and use your battle gold to buy, upgrade, or remove your cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat: Fast-paced combat, a smooth poker experience, and plenty of time before each battle to think about how to deal with the enemy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemies: The enemies you encounter change every time you start a new game, and choose different strategies against different enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFINALLOOP\u300b is a card building rougelike game\uff0cThe game uses real-time combat. Discover stronger combinations, build the strongest loops, and be prepared not to stop playing your cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic building: Hundreds of cards with different attributes and effects, constantly strengthen your deck, and use your battle gold to buy, upgrade, or remove your cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat: Fast-paced combat, a smooth poker experience, and plenty of time before each battle to think about how to deal with the enemy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemies: The enemies you encounter change every time you start a new game, and choose different strategies against different enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u300aFINALLOOP\u300b is a roguelike game that combines real-time combat with deckbuilding mechanics. Engage in fast-paced battles where every decision matters, face ever-changing enemies and challenges, and build unique decks to craft your ultimate tactical playstyle!",
